<title>HONG KONG: New World to sell flats at raised prices.</title>
<headline>New World to sell flats at raised prices.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New World Development Co Ltd and HKR International said on Thursday they were selling 98 flats in Phase two of their joint venture Discovery Park residential development at about HK$5,898 per square foot.</p>
<p>That compared with a price of HK$5,000 per square foot in the last sale in September.</p>
<p>The development comprises 12 high rise residential towers and a commercial centre in Tsuen Wan in the New Territories. The flats range in size from 593 to 835 sq ft.</p>
<p>The units will go on sale on March 27.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
